  "notes": "Community/childcare building (sign reads a phone number). Two-storey cream house (#ece5d6) with orange terracotta hip roof (#c05a34) and rooftop solar panel. Timber gabled entrance porch/pergola (#8a5a2f) shelters the front door. Upper-floor windows have security grilles (bars not expressible). Right wing is a lower flat-roofed block with a white-railed balcony and a wall-mounted signboard. Frontage is a white picket fence over a rough stone rockery base with a grey panel pedestrian door on the right; lush palms/shrubs and a large foreground tree. Sampled colours 2026-07-04."
